WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.010
I want the three of you to make a video.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.800
Oh.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.550
A video? For what?

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:20.550
A Cinderella Project PR video.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.200
With it, you will have
an international debut!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:24.730
Huh?

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.110
Wait. He never said that.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.020
Oh, come on!

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.690
This stuff's about having fun!

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:36.490
And so, let's get this video on the road!

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:40.940
Surprise interviews
of everyone in the project!

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:46.040
Let's get up-close and personal
with our future stars!

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:23.990
Shimamu.

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:24.660
Huh?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.980
Shouldn't you say something?

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:33.020
Um, right. This is the
Cinderella Project Room.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.230
Should we show them the room?

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.490
Oh! Someone's here already!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.840
...Morning...

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.910
And our first idol is Miku-meow!

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:53.710
What'cha filming?

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:58.090
Caught you with your
pants down, Miku-meow.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.610
It's for the PR video
Producer was talking about.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.430
Meow!

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.150
She's a cat now?

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.520
Do you always carry cat ears with you?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:11.700
Of course!

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:15.190
So I'm always ready for work anytimeow!

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.570
You're a workaholic?

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:19.460
Oh, and to all of you watching meow.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.860
Maekawa Miku'll take work anytimeow!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.920
I'll work like a cat,

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.580
so help make meow a star!

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.270
And cut! We're good.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.420
Should we get a clip like that for everyone?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:35.290
How much time should everyone get?

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.100
Wait, that's it?!

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.870
That totally wasn't enough time
to show people what I'm like!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.280
Oh. The camera's still rolling.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:48.970
Meow I'm going to head to dance practice
so you can see meow live soon!

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.970
Wow.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.190
We're here at the training room!

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:59.880
Let's head in!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.830
Well? Well?

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.000
I did it, right?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.380
Yeah!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:09.050
And if you roll your eyes up,
it's even better!

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.660
Roll my eyes up?

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.160
Like this?

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:15.670
And then you can
try lying down like this!

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.480
I see, I see.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.340
Wh-What are you meowing?!

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.830
Stop the camera right meow!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:22.590
O-Okay.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:24.330
Rika.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.740
What do you think you're teaching Miria?

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:30.060
Oh, come on. Everyone'll love it.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.430
Meow, meow, meow.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:33.560
Oh, a camera!

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.290
Are you filming?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.990
Yeah, I was curious about that too.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.650
H-Hey! Listen to meow!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.660
We're here to make a PR video.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.780
Oh, you're filming it today?

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:49.820
Hey, hey! What do we do for a PR video?

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:51.770
Jeez, you don't know?

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:55.260
Let me show you what we do!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.050
I can do that too!

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:00.040
Very nice. Very nice!

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.340
We obviously can't show that.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.210
Why not?!

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.710
Maybe when you're more meowture.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:09.590
For meow, a cute kitty pose.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.150
Come on! I don't wanna be all kiddy!

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:13.540
How about something like this?

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.380
A lion!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.560
Roar!

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.060
...Mew might eat kitty meow...

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:19.590
Should we use that for your bit?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:22.570
Meow! The cat thing
is meowne, so meow!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.170
...Aw...

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.530
...Then...

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.490
I'll dance like my sister!

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.740
And action.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.150
My excitement escalates all the way up.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:37.710
I'm in love mode and ready to pop like cider.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.250
Wow!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.710
I wanna dance too!

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.670
That's Mika's song!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.920
It'll be me on stage next time.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:44.890
Well?

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.490
Ta-dah!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.780
Hey! I got it all perfect that time!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:53.690
I can dance too,
so put me in concerts too!

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:56.070
Me too! I wanna be in a concert too!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:59.560
Wait! You're too close! I can't film!

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:02.440
Okay, um... Rika, you're up first!

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.690
Three, two, one.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.410
I'm Jougasaki Rika!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:11.050
My dream is to be like my big sister!

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.540
...And, uh...

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:14.300
I like collecting stickers,

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.540
...and I'm good at catching weird bugs—

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.720
Hiya! I'm Akagi Miria!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:25.160
I wanna dance and
...wear cute dresses, and...

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.960
I wanna do a lotta stuff!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:30.120
Hey! We just said
we were gonna take turns!

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.820
You two are way too close!

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.980
I still have more to say!

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:35.970
Me too! Me too!

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.520
Stop the camera.
Someone's going to get hurt.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.330
Turns!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.980
Line up and stand still!

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:45.340
Oh, to be young!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.430
Kids these days have got too much energy.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.790
Mio, you sound like my grandma.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.370
Where should we go next?

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.700
Where haven't we gone?

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.560
...S-Save me...

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.410
...Oh? Is Anzu up nex—

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:06.750
Whoa.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.010
A monster?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.120
Nywope!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.760
...Oh, it's you, Kirarin...

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:17.050
Y-You surprised me.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.650
Sorry!

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:24.150
I'm carr'in' Anzu 'a help
ou' wi' filmin' a movie!

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:28.260
I said I wasn't going to work.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.650
Nope! Work's really impor'an'!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.360
This job looks... interesting.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.910
You in'res'ed, Rin?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:37.910
Huh?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.220
...Rin in a monster suit...

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.460
I can't picture it!

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:45.170
All I said was that it's "interesting"!

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.670
You'd be really cute!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.920
How the heck can you
even wear that thing?

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:57.700
I's super fun! Mons'ers're cute!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:02.170
Cute's nice, but I'd rather
have jobs with royalties.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.600
C'mon, le's do some
happy-happy wor'in' toge'er!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:09.560
Well, then let's get some of that
happy-happy on camera!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.390
Nywokay!

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.680
Can I go first?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.820
Okay.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:22.490
I wan' everybo'y 'a be
happy-happy wi' me!

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:26.710
So give me a lo'a work, please!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:28.960
Nex's you, Anzu!

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:31.000
Huh?

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.070
Huh-uh?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.670
Anzu?

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:37.080
Nothing on Earth's gonna make me work!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.680
Wait, Anzu!

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.630
Kirari Monster Dash!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.020
Roar! Loo' ou', loo' ou'!

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:48.520
...We didn't get Anzu...

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.140
We'll get her later.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:56.330
Now let's take some time
to plan what we should do.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:08:59.870
Are you hungry?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:05.660
Why don't we take a break at the cafe?

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.040
Oh?

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:11.550
I'm Mimura Kanako.

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.410
I'm having tea with Chieri right now.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.130
...For today I made...

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.220
Ta-dah!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:26.150
I love making sweets,
so I baked some cookies!

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.870
Wow! They smell great!

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:30.270
Can I have one?

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.200
Here. Open wide.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.860
It's so good!

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.960
I brought some tea too.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.020
Thanks!

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.410
You're the best!

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:45.370
Try some of these muffins too.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.180
I will! Thank you!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.250
Thanks.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.250
Oh, it brings peace to my mind.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:55.270
Little cups of happiness!

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.590
They're really good.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:01.090
Everything tastes great
when you eat together!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.280
Isn't baking all these a lot of work?

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:05.940
Not really.

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:09.960
I like it, and it's fun to talk over tea.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:13.390
Yeah! It's so much fun!

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:16.900
...Hey...

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:17.490
Hm?

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.010
Aren't you forgetting
what we came here to do?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:24.580
I didn't forget!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.150
W-We're so sorry!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.580
...Um, um...

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.750
Next up is Chieri!

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:32.780
...Um...

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.690
...I'm Ogata Chieri...

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:37.940
...I'm a second-year in high school...

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:40.250
...Um... I...

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.380
You brought notes?

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:43.050
Chieri!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.690
Look into the camera!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.810
...O-Okay...

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:50.960
Come back!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.810
Hey— Wait!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:58.700
...My notes are gone...

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:02.950
Chieri, have some cookies.
Let's stay cheery.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.170
Okay?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.910
...Oh, clovers...

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.420
Maybe something good will happen.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.040
Ooh!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.930
Thanks for that beautiful smile!

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:16.790
Huh?

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.250
She got it on camera.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.390
Oh, right.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:27.060
Ranko asked us to give this to you.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:27.890
Here.

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.810
A message card?

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.850
What's it say?

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:38.070
"When the angel hymns,
at the holy spring shall I sit."

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:44.280
"Bring in hand with you the vessel for
...sealing souls so as to bind me to this plane."

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.440
"Kanzaki Ranko."

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:52.060
What does "when the angel hymns" mean?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:55.130
"The holy spring" sounds like a place, right?

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:58.120
What's the "vessel" supposed to be?

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.600
Curiouser and curiouser.

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:06.700
That's why I think we'll be practicing that today.

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.740
Found our next targets!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:06.700
Mio?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.150
What about Ranko's letter?

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:09.510
We'll get to it later!

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:11.500
Surprise interview!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.910
I'm Nitta Minami, a college student.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:18.060
I look forward to working with you.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:23.060
Menya zovut Anastasia.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:26.490
My name is Anastasia.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.640
...Hm...

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.270
Huh? We can't use that?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.960
They did a great job.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:39.640
But I wanted something more like,
"Ohmigosh, whaddo I do? Ohmigosh!"

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.270
...Um...

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:46.270
I'm, uh, sorry?

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:49.240
What's that?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:52.470
This? It's a lacrosse stick.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:53.980
I've got it!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:59.110
I'm Nitta Minami! A college student!

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.740
I look forward to working with you!

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:02.400
Nice! Very nice!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.420
I call it "air lacrosse"!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:10.040
Does this really work for a PR video?

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:11.580
Of course!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:15.710
Our project's gonna get super famous
overnight, no doubt about it!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:20.280
Minami, heading out!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:21.740
Anya, you too!

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:24.120
Shake those pom-poms!

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:27.380
Zhelayu udachi, Minami.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.920
I'm in a lacrosse club at my college!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:34.460
I love trying new things!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.800
Very nice!

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.060
Let's keep it up, Anya! Go ahead!

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.330
I am Anastasia.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.820
My papa is Russia.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.930
My mama is Japanese.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.940
I love to looking the stars.

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.180
All right! That's a wrap!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.410
You both look awesome!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.850
...Th-There are so many people...

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.870
Minami, you are okay?

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.470
...Y-Yeah...

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:02.620
But I never imagined
...doing something like this...

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.750
You were wonderful on camera!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:08.360
Yes, idols do much variety of things.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.390
They very wonderful.

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:13.640
Right? I think so too!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.460
You worked very hard for the concert.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.650
So I think I work hard being idol too.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.290
Oh, that!

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:29.630
Minamin!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.140
Hm?

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.740
Could you help us out?

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.530
It is now five o'clock.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:41.250
It is time for all the good boys
and girls to head back home.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.500
Let's stay safe on our ways home.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.510
I commend you for coming.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:50.130
Bingo, Minamin!

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:50.130
It is now five o'clock.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:54.220
It is time for all the good boys
and girls to head back home.

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.390
It is like a spring.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.640
This is what she meant by "angel hymns"?

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:56.640
Let's stay safe on our ways home.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:15:01.070
The Fates guided my end to this plane.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.180
My name is Kanzaki Ranko.

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.840
As an image of worship shall
...I fling open the gates of destruc—

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.090
H-Hold up!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.650
...Sorry, but...

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:10.860
...Um...

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:14.550
...About the vessel for sealing souls...

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.780
Does this work?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:18.940
Or this?

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.190
I get the feeling it doesn't.

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:26.040
You hold the vessel in hand, do you not?

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.690
Huh?

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.920
You mean... the camera?

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.360
Indeed!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.800
Now seal my soul within it!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:37.810
O-Okay!

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:45.560
As the twilight falls, I feast
my blood red eyes upon this world with grief.

00:15:46.310 --> 00:15:47.690
The time has come.

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.220
Now, jointly the hammer of destruction
shall we drop upon this world!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.030
Cut! Cut!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:53.800
Huh?

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.550
Ranran, you're talking all weird.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.230
Wh-What? "Ranran", you call me?

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.640
Could you translate for us later?

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.870
You dare sound my name
in an unfamiliar tongue?

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.810
What audacity.

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:13.100
Our feast ends here tonight.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.450
Time evolves with the greatest haste.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.350
The darkness engulfs you all!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.730
Man, we worked all day today!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.200
Shimamu, catch!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.530
Breaktime!

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:32.810
...Um...

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:35.220
Who else is left?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.070
Riina and Anzu, I think.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:38.860
Oh.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.960
Riina's here!

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:42.860
Yeah.

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:45.470
But it looks like she's
listening to something.

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.760
I don't want to bother her.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.960
Should we do her later?

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:55.260
Man, those riffs! Now <i>that's</i> rock!

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.590
Rock's life, man.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:03.240
Riina, we're making a PR video!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.950
Oh, right, we were gonna do that.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.560
What were you up to, Riina?

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.180
I just kinda got lost in some rock music.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:18.900
Guess that's just how it goes for a rock idol.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:19.880
Really?

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:21.340
That's so cool!

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:26.970
You know I'm gonna
be a star as soon as I debut,

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:29.580
so this video's worth its weight in gold.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:31.690
Oh, really?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.800
Big talker, huh?

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:36.740
I'm gonna be a cool, rock idol!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.220
...I'll pack the Budokan with a full house...

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.970
and make rock history with my concerts!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.400
Well, that's how it's gonna be,

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:51.520
so you might wanna keep your eyes on me.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.530
Any songs you recommend?

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:59.420
Rock's not something you ask other people for.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:04.200
Yeah! If you think it's rock, it's rock!

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.750
What was that?!

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:09.040
Anzu!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:12.970
Where'd you go?

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:18.700
Miria helped ou' wi'
filmin' tha' movie, you know?

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.890
It was lots of fun!

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.330
We haven't seen her either.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:24.890
...And...

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:29.310
Anzu's the only one
we haven't filmed yet.

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:33.530
We'd better find her soon,
or we'll have to finish it up tomorrow.

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:34.780
Okay, then!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.960
I'll have 'a use

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:39.860
my ul'ima'e weapon!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:46.080
Super Happy-Happy Candy Shower!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:48.580
Candy!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:52.900
<i>That's</i> where you were hiding?!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.920
Anzu!

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:55.940
Caugh' you!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.800
C-Crap!

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.010
Would you mind PR-ing for us again?

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.160
Why?

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:06.560
I don't want to work or anything.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.550
Please? We're begging you.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:11.140
That's not really the issue here.

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:14.340
I have eight days a week off.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.480
I'm off work today.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:21.240
Yeah, that doesn't really work for PR.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:25.560
Ma'in' thin's 'ard on people's no' a good girl.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.210
Everybo'y wan's 'a see you, Anzu.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:31.910
...I guess you <i>did</i> give me candy...

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.960
Thank you so much!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:36.420
Now we'll finally have PR from everyone!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.380
We're almost there.

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:41.880
I'd better put on something
nice for the camera.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:44.540
I <i>am</i> an idol, after all,

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.890
so could you leave
the room while I change?

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.510
You're jus' so shy, Anzu!

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:51.640
Couldn't you use the reception to change?

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.830
Well, you're already at the door.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.100
...All right, then. We'll be wait—

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:57.940
—ing?...

00:19:57.940 --> 00:19:59.380
Got you!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.480
This room's mine now!

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.120
I'm not setting one foot out of it!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.320
Wh-Wh-What?! Anzu!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:04.760
What?!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:07.320
Hey! Open up! Open up!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.750
Are we playing hide-and-seek?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:11.500
This is bad! Please open the door!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.360
Should we go borrow a key?

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.920
Anzu! I've go' even yummier candy!

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.000
What are you guys doing?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.190
Is the door locked?

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:19.920
Meow!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.460
Meow bag is in there!

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.660
I can't go homeow without it!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:25.680
...Me neither...

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:28.730
Anzu! Please open the door!

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.520
Resistance is futile!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:34.150
Cease your futile resistance and turn yourself in!

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:36.270
We're not getting this done today, are we?

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.440
You freaking... Anzu! Work!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.110
...One, two...

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:41.900
We

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:42.710
hope

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:43.320
you'll

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:44.150
choose

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:45.650
the

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:46.620
...Cin—

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:47.660
—de—

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:48.660
—rel—

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.660
—la...

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.540
...Pro—

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.040
—ject...

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:52.660
for

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:53.330
your

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:54.590
production!

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:03.540
We did it!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:05.220
We're done!

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:06.900
Good job.

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:07.930
...Wait, hold on...

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:10.260
What about us?

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.220
Ah.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.100
Ah!

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:15.420
Wh-What do we do now?!

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.700
We'd better get it done now!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:17.700
I forgot all about it.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:18.600
I'll get the camer—ah!

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:22.110
Producer, the Chief would like to see you.

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:29.370
I wonder what it's about!

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.370
He might have something huge for us!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:34.120
Like a debut!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.260
A debut?!

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:40.810
Thank you for your work on the PR video.

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:41.800
...We will be...

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.470
utilizing it in the near future.

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:52.930
I have an announcement for you all today.

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:57.060
D-Did someowne get a job?!

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:58.540
Wow!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:00.660
Hey, it's for me, right?!

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:03.440
Meow way! It's for meow!

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:07.240
They need my rockin' soul already.

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:10.650
We only took the video yesterday, though.

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:12.040
You're right.

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.000
What's this about, then?

00:22:18.860 --> 00:22:21.290
Starting with Nitta Minami

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.790
and Anastasia,

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.270
...and then Shimamura Uzuki...

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:28.420
Y-Yes?

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:30.430
...Shibuya Rin,...

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:32.800
and Honda Mio.

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:39.440
You will be breaking up into units
within the project for CD debuts.

00:22:40.940 --> 00:22:44.080
CD debuts?
